        "original_id": "4f59d6cb-c53b-5771-9068-b7c2cb35a1e8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Schmalturm turret, Panzerkampfwagen IV (Panzer IV)\n- Projects: Panther II, VK 30.02 DB\n- Topics: German medium tanks, Second World War\n\nFacts:\n- The Panzerkampfwagen IV, commonly known as the Panzer IV, was a German medium tank developed in the late 1930s.\n- The Panzer IV was used extensively during the Second World War.\n- The Schmalturm turret was a tank turret designed for use on the Panzer V Ausf. B Panther II medium tank.\n- The Schmalturm turret was designed for use on the Panther A and Panther G medium tanks.\n- The Schmalturm turret was designed for use on the Panzer IV Ausf. J medium tank.\n- The Schmalturm turret was designed for use on the VK 30.02 DB medium tank prototype.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
