        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "063e9a61-e28f-54bf-ab50-42a01c10f42e",
        "text": "Page: Schmalturm. Sentence: The Schmalturm turret was a tank turret designed for use on the Panzer V Ausf.\nPage: Schmalturm. Sentence: B Panther II medium tank, Panther A and G medium tank, Panzer IV Ausf.\nPage: Schmalturm. Sentence: J medium tank and the VK 30.02 DB (a medium tank prototype).\nPage: Panzer IV. Sentence: The \"Panzerkampfwagen\" IV (PzKpfw IV), commonly known as the Panzer IV, was a German medium tank developed in the late 1930s and used extensively during the Second World War.",
